      "value": "Ms X complains the Council did not properly investigate a safeguarding referral. She also complaints it delayed providing her with a copy of its report and communicated with her poorly. She says this caused her and her family avoidable and unnecessary distress. We find no fault with the Council’s safeguarding investigation. We find fault with the Council’s communication and delay providing Ms X with the report, which caused Ms X injustice. We are satisfied the action taken by the Council has remedied the injustice to Ms X.",
